caption: Tradition Authority
engine-rule: tradition-authority

The Wuxia Tradition, rather than the individual Style, defines the legal mundane foundations, Style-construction boundaries, Duan Wei requirements, consequential-use standards, Mastery requirements and demonstrations, family catalog, family rules, and interactions with the Domain's Origins and other Traditions.

When an associated Sage Tradition exists, that Sage Tradition defines the personal-family selection procedure required to reach five total family Masteries, every family Mastery test and Enhancement, Sage consequential-use standards, Sage Mastery requirements and demonstrations, and the Lineage Revision procedure. The Wuxia Tradition defines the legal Advanced Supernatural Unlock catalog or construction procedure, and each institutional Style fixes two Advanced Supernatural Unlocks as Wuxia Style fields. Sage supplies only the Fourth- and Fifth-Dan activation milestones.
